{
  "name": "sperm-whale",
  "_about": "THE SPERM WHALE (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/bigmam/sperm_whale.py, built from scratch on the humpback's/dolphin's plan): 13 m -- the ENORMOUS BOX-SHAPED HEAD a third of the length (two rounded boxes: the front blunt and squared, flat-topped, the snout overhanging the mouth), the NARROW rod-like LOWER JAW slung under it, white-lipped, its tip a metre back; the single S-shaped BLOWHOLE at the head's front, to the left; the small eye far back by the mouth's corner; small stubby paddle flippers; no dorsal fin but a low rounded HUMP two thirds back and a row of KNUCKLES behind it, the post-anal keel under the stock; broad triangular flukes with a straight trailing edge and a deep notch. Dark slate grey, the belly a shade paler, pale scars on the head; the skin a faint mottle (the `ridges` wrinkles were tried and dropped: they read as bold rib bands). Coats: slate grey, brown-grey, a pale old bull. A swimmer (`fly`); its tail pitches. Written whole by its script.",
